---
import '../../styles/global.css';
import '../../styles/about.css';

import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import GlobalFooter from '../../components/GlobalFooter.astro';
import GlobalNavbar from "../../components/GlobalNavbar.astro";

import CasualPhoto from "../../imgs/CasualLiluWithPuckmanPhoto.png";
import GHCPhoto from "../../imgs/GHCJumbotronPhoto.png";
---

<html>
  <body>

    <GlobalNavbar />

    <div class="about-section">

      <h1>About Me</h1>
      <p>You're asking about little old me? I'm flattered.</p>

      <hr>

      <div class="about-story">
        <div class="about-story-left">
          <h2>My &lt;/Story&gt; </h2>
          <p>From data structures to drawing I have a passion for seeing ideas become tangible.  The versatility of technology inspires me everyday pursuing  my dual major of Computer Science and Information Technologies  and Web Sciences at Rensselear Polytechnic Institute.</p>
          <p>Beyond the classroom, I consistently contribute to clubs I believe make a positive impact to the community. </p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-story-right">
          <Image 
            src={CasualPhoto}
            alt="Photo of Lilu Kaufman With Puckman"
            width="525"
            height="500"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <hr>

      <div class="about-values">
        <div class="about-values-left">
          <Image 
            src={GHCPhoto}
            alt="Photo of Lilu Kaufman On Jumbotron At Grace Hopper"
            width="525"
            height="500"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="about-values-right">
          <h2>My &lt;/Values&gt; </h2>
          <p>I hope to combine my creativity and love for programming to advance the  current capabilities of technologies in the goal of helping  others. I thoroughly enjoy problem-solving and aim to use my imagination to allow me to view issues from new perspectives. </p>
          <p>I thrive on collaborating and value fresh POVs. My approach  to issues involves addressing obstacles head-on utilizing  effective communication. I aspire to create a balance  between my love for STEM and the arts while having a positive impact on  communities worldwide.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>

    <div class="about-end">
      <h1>TLDR; I work hard and play hard.</h1>
    </div>

    <GlobalFooter />

  </body>
</html>